    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n37054" root="كغد" body-key="k">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">كَاغَدٌ</span></b> , (Msb, K,) and <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">كَاغِدٌ</span>, (L, TA,) <i>Paper;</i>
syn. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">قِرْطَاسٌ</span> [which seems to be properly <i>paper
made of the papyrus</i>]: (K:) a Persian word,
(L,) arabicized. (L, K.) The <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">د</span> is sometimes
changed into <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">ذ</span>, (Msb, TA,) and into <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">ط</span>. (TA.)

